text:
{
  "name": "魔法的流派",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:lightning_bottle",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 20,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "概述",
      "text": "每個法術都屬於一個流派的魔法。 每個流派都有一個主題，無論是視覺上還是功能上，每個流派都有一個重點：一個用作製作原料的代表性物品。此外，每個流派都可以通過與流派相關的特定裝備來增強實力，讓您成為單個流派的強大大師，或混合搭配成為萬事通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:blaze_rod",
      "title": "火",
      "text": "火系以「烈焰桿」為核心，著重在傷害和傷害時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:frozen_bone",
      "title": "冰",
      "text": "冰雪流派以 「冰封之骨(Frozen Bones)」為核心，著重傷害和人羣控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:lightning_bottle",
      "title": "閃電",
      "text": "閃電流派以「閃電瓶(Bottle o' Lightning)」為核心，著重單體傷害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:divine_pearl",
      "title": "神聖",
      "text": "神聖流派以「神珠(Divine Pearl)為核心」，著重輔助、治療和為盟友加持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:ender_pearl",
      "title": "終界",
      "text": "終界流派以「終界珍珠」為核心，著重一切奧術和神祕事物，其法術範圍包括傷害、實用性和機動性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:blood_vial",
      "title": "血",
      "text": "血魔法流派以「血瓶」為核心，以邪惡為主題；在這裡，你會發現亡靈魔法、枯萎魔法和血魔法的元素，法術的重點是對施法者造成傷害，並給施法者加成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:emerald",
      "title": "喚魔",
      "text": "喚魔學派以「綠寶石」為核心，魔法詭計和幻術為主題，涵蓋了最廣泛的攻擊、防禦和實用法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:poisonous_potato",
      "title": "自然",
      "text": "自然流派以「毒馬鈴薯」為核心，主要是對敵人施加debuff，並通過傷害元素來終結敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:eldritch_manuscript",
      "title": "埃爾德里奇(Eldritch)",
      "text": "埃爾德里奇學派與其他學派不同。這是一種古老而強大的魔法，已經被人們遺忘；你無法立即製作或施放埃爾德里奇法術。然而，古老的埃爾德里奇手稿碎片仍然散落在世界各地，甚至可以在回聲碎片(echo shard)的幫助下重新拼湊起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:echo_shard",
      "title": "埃爾德里奇：續",
      "text": "修復手稿後，消耗手稿可以學習一個埃爾德里奇法術，從而可以製作和施放該法術。學習完成後，回聲碎片將被用作該流派核心。"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "關於 ParCool",
  "description": "本章介紹本模組的設計理念與相關資訊。",
  "icon": "minecraft:book",
  "sortnum": 0
}

{
  "name": "跑酷動作",
  "description": "本章介紹 ParCool 新增的各種動作與能力，以及它們的操作方式。",
  "icon": "minecraft:feather",
  "sortnum": 1
}

{
  "name": "其他功能",
  "description": "本章介紹 ParCool 新增的其他跑酷功能。",
  "icon": "minecraft:iron_hoe",
  "sortnum": 2
}

{
  "name": "什麼是 ParCool？",
  "icon": "minecraft:feather",
  "category": "parcool:category_about",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "感謝你遊玩本模組！$(br2)ParCool 是 Minecraft Forge 模組，新增許多$(bold)跑酷$()等帥氣動作。$(br)其中一些動作來自真實的跑酷技巧。$(br2)現在，你也是跑酷玩家了。一起奔馳於 Minecraft 世界吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/logo_round.png"
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "什麼是跑酷？",
  "icon": "minecraft:golden_boots",
  "category": "parcool:category_about",
  "sortnum": 2,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(italic)跑酷（Parkour）$()是由$(italic)大衛·貝爾（David Belle）$()推廣的運動。$(br)跑酷的目標是僅憑自身能力，盡可能快速地移動到另一個地點。$(br2)名稱源自法文$(italic)parcours$()，參與者稱為$(italic)Traceur$()。$(br)跑酷有時也被稱為$(italic)Free Running$()，這個名稱被視為其英文譯稱。"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "製作人員",
  "icon": "minecraft:written_book",
  "category": "parcool:category_about",
  "sortnum": 5,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "以下列出模組開發者與翻譯者。$(br2)也感謝所有未列名的貢獻者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "模組開發者",
      "text": "主要開發$()$(italic)$(list)alRex-U$()"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "音效",
      "text": "$(italic)$(list)SquARzY"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "英文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)en_us$()$(italic)$(list)alRex-U"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "日文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)ja_jp$()$(italic)$(list)alRex-U"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "中文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)ch_zn$()$(italic)$(list)CatalystGinger$(list)GuoDaiYi$(list)njt-233$(list)Kasualix"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "法文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)fr-fr$()$(italic)$(list)COwOkie"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "巴西葡萄牙文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)pt-br$()$(italic)$(list)FITFC"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "西班牙文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)es-es$()$(italic)$(list)GhostOfCazador$(list)elAltrex"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "韓文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)ko-kr$()$(italic)$(list)Mexwell12"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "俄文翻譯",
      "text": "$(bold)ru-ru$()$(italic)$(list)MasterXort"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "體力",
  "icon": "minecraft:golden_apple",
  "category": "parcool:category_about",
  "sortnum": 3,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "本模組新增體力機制。$(br2)使用跑酷動作會消耗體力。體力耗盡時會受到以下限制：$(list)無法疾走，移動速度降低$(list)無法使用大多數跑酷動作$(br)請留意剩餘體力。"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "受身（落地緩衝）",
  "icon": "minecraft:slime_ball",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)受身$()是減輕落地衝擊的技巧。$(br2)本模組提供兩種受身動作：$(bold)翻滾$()與$(bold)屈膝緩衝$()。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/breakfall_tap.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "翻滾",
      "text": "$(bold)翻滾$()是受身技巧之一，能將落地衝擊轉化為翻滾的動能。$(br2)跑酷的翻滾屬於落地技巧，因此本模組也只能在落地時使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)落地時同時按住前進或後退鍵，以及受身鍵（$(k:parcool.Breakfall)）"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "屈膝緩衝",
      "text": "$(bold)屈膝緩衝$()是受身技巧之一，透過彎曲雙腿吸收落地衝擊。$(br2)不過，史蒂夫究竟是怎麼彎腿的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)落地時按住受身鍵（$(k:parcool.Breakfall)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "貓撲",
  "icon": "minecraft:cat_spawn_egg",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)貓撲$()是跳躍並抓住牆頂、柵欄等邊緣的技巧，也是跑酷的基本動作之一。$(br)跑酷者會利用腿部動作吸收落地衝擊。$(br2)本模組將此技巧實作為長距離跳躍，請留意冷卻時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() 使用$(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)疾跑$()$(br)$(bold)2.$() 快速蹲下$(br)$(bold)3.$() 快速解除蹲下$(br2)建議搭配$(l:parcool:actions/cling_to_cliff)貓掛（邊緣懸掛）$()使用。"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "蓄力跳躍",
  "icon": "minecraft:rabbit_foot",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)蓄力跳躍$()能讓你跳得更高，便於跨越柵欄與攀上高牆。$(br2)這個技巧雖然簡單，卻十分實用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/charge_jump_1.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() 原地蹲下數秒$(br)$(bold)2.$() 同時放開蹲下鍵並按下跳躍鍵。"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "攀爬竿柱",
  "icon": "minecraft:quartz_pillar",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你可以攀爬堆疊的柵欄、鎖鏈、鐵柵欄等竿柱狀方塊。"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "貓掛（邊緣懸掛）",
  "icon": "minecraft:stone",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你可以抓住方塊邊緣並懸掛在上面，也能緩慢移動。$(br)按下跳躍鍵即可攀上方塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/cling_to_cliff_1.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/cling_to_cliff_2.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)靠近牆壁時按下貓掛鍵（$(k:parcool.ClingToCliff)）$(br)"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "匍匐",
  "icon": "minecraft:nautilus_shell",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你可以匍匐前進，穿過狹窄通道。$(br)也可以參考$(l:parcool:actions/slide)滑行$()。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/crawl.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)按下匍匐鍵（$(k:parcool.Crawl)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "俯衝",
  "icon": "minecraft:cod",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "ParCool 新增特殊跳躍動畫：$(bold)俯衝$()。切換成第三人稱視角就能看見。俯衝數秒後再次按下跳躍鍵，還能進入高空俯衝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/dive.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() 使用$(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)疾跑$()$(br)$(bold)2.$() 從高處跳向有足夠空間的位置"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "閃避",
  "icon": "minecraft:arrow",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)閃避$()能讓你快速移動一小段距離，以避開子彈或箭矢。$(br)請留意冷卻時間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/dodge.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)連按兩次方向鍵（前進鍵除外）$(list)同時按下方向鍵與閃避鍵（$(k:parcool.Dodge)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "疾跑",
  "icon": "minecraft:diamond_boots",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "現在你也是跑酷玩家，可以跑得比以前更快！疾跑是 ParCool 的基本能力，也是一些其他動作的前置條件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/fast_run.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)疾走時持續按住疾跑鍵（$(k:parcool.FastRun)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "快速游泳",
  "icon": "minecraft:water_bucket",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你也能使用$(bold)快速游泳$()，以更快的速度在水中前進，並呈現專屬動畫。$(br2)操作方式與疾跑相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)快速游泳時持續按住疾跑鍵（$(k:parcool.FastRun)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "空翻",
  "icon": "minecraft:blaze_powder",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "ParCool 新增特殊跳躍動畫：$(bold)空翻$()。$(br2)你可以做出前空翻與後空翻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/flipping_2.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)同時按下向左與向右移動鍵$(list)按下空翻鍵（$(k:parcool.Flipping)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "掛槓（吊掛）",
  "icon": "minecraft:stone",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你可以吊掛在鎖鏈或終界燭等方塊下方。$(br2)也能移動，或按下跳躍鍵向前跳出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/hang_down.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)在橫向細長方塊下方按下掛槓鍵（$(k:parcool.HangDown)）$(br)"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "藏身方塊",
  "icon": "minecraft:hay_block",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你可以藏身在方塊中。$(br2)藏身時敵人更難發現你，其他玩家也看不到你的名稱。$(br2)可藏身的方塊包括：$(list)樹葉方塊$(list)乾草捆"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/hide_in_block.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)在可藏身方塊旁蹲下，並按下藏身方塊鍵（$(k:parcool.HideInBlock)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "橫向跑牆",
  "icon": "minecraft:bricks",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你可以貼著牆壁橫向奔跑，藉此跳到遠處的平臺。$(br2)請留意，$(l:actions/wall_run)跑牆$()原本指的是垂直向上跑牆，而非橫向奔跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/horizontal_wall_run.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() 在空中沿牆壁使用$(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)疾跑$()$(br)$(bold)2.$() 持續按住橫向跑牆鍵（$(k:parcool.HorizontalWallRun)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "快速轉身",
  "icon": "minecraft:iron_helmet",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "只要按下一個按鍵，就能快速轉身面向後方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "操作方式",
      "text": "$(list)按下快速轉身鍵（$(k:parcool.QuickTurn)）"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "滑行",
  "icon": "minecraft:yellow_dye",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)滑行$()是由$(l:parcool:actions/crawl)匍匐$()衍生的動作，能讓你快速穿過狹窄空間。"
    },
    {
